OL,3,GNEWSAHow easy is it to find an NHS
OL,4,Adentist? It depends where you live
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of dentist practices are
OL,7,Fabandoning NHS work as the service
OL,8,Fdrifts towards a two-tier system, new
OL,9,Fanalysis suggests.
OL,11,FData analysed by the Nuffield Trust
OL,12,Ffound that nearly 600 practices in
OL,13,FEngland have withdrawn from NHS
OL,14,Fdentistry over the last 10 years. The
OL,15,Fdecline has been particularly sharp in
OL,16,Fparts of the South West and East of
OL,17,FEngland, raising concerns about growing
OL,18,Finequalities in access to care.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
