OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAHow easy is it to find an NHS
OL,4,Adentist? It depends where you live
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe analysis suggests more than one in
OL,7,F10 dental practices that once offered
OL,8,FNHS care no longer do so, leaving it
OL,9,Fnear impossible for some communities to
OL,10,Ffind NHS appointments.
OL,12,FNHS dental activity is 8% lower than it
OL,13,Fwas pre Covid, while six in 10 adults
OL,14,Fhave not seen an NHS dentist in two
OL,15,Fyears. Of those who attempted to get a
OL,16,Fnew appointment in the last two years,
OL,17,Fjust 38% were successful, according to
OL,18,Fa Nuffield Trust Survey.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
